{"id":1108,"level":40,"name":"Дістанься прапорця (1)","group":"Взяти фігуру","format":35,"description":"<h3>What do you have to do?</h3>  <p>In this game, you have to capture the flag. But you can&rsquo;t simply walk to the flag. Not all squares are safe. Black&rsquo;s pieces are guarding the flag. Make sure you don&rsquo;t move to a defended square. These are squares that the opponent's pieces have direct access to. Try to find a way to the flag without allowing the opponent to capture your piece.</p>  <p><img src='chessity/assets/illustrations/7654c58e10381679.png' alt='' /></p>  <p><br />Collect coins to score points. Your end goal is the flag.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":2,"examples":[{"fen":"5F2/3r4/8/8/8/2B5/8/8 w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":"{$minus,d6,d5,d4,d3,d2,d1,d8,c7,b7,a7,e7,f7,g7,h7 $arrow,green,c3,b4 $arrow,green,b4,f8} 1. Bb4 {$clear} -- 2. Bf8  1-0","text":"","format":35},{"fen":"3B2nF/8/8/r7/8/8/8/8 w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":"{$minus,b5,c5,d5,e5,f5,g5,h5,a4,a3,a2,a1,a6,a7,a8,e7,f6,h6 $arrow,green,d8,b6 $arrow,green,b6,d4 $arrow,green,d4,h8}1. Bb6 {$clear} -- 2. Bd4 -- 3. Bh8  1-0","text":"","format":35},{"fen":"3r3b/4F3/2c5/8/8/5N2/8/8 w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":"{$minus,d7,d6,d5,d4,d3,d2,d1,c8,b8,a8,e8,f8,g8,h8,g7,f6,e5,d4,c3,b2,a1 $arrow,green,f3,e1 $arrow,green,e1,c2 $arrow,green,c2,b4 $arrow,green,b4,c6 $arrow,green,c6,e7}1. Ne1 {$clear} -- 2. Nc2 -- 3. Nb4 -- 4. Nc6 -- 5. Ne7  1-0","text":"","format":35}],"puzzles":[{"id":35897,"fen":"8/8/8/8/5R2/2r5/8/1c1F4 w - 0 1 $YY","pgn":"1. Rb4 -- 2. Rb1 -- 3. Rd1  1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":35898,"fen":"8/1c1F4/8/8/8/8/5R2/2r5 w - 0 1 $YY","pgn":"1. Rb2 -- 2. Rb7 -- 3. Rd7 1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":35905,"fen":"8/4Q3/8/8/8/c7/5bF1/8 w - 0 1 $YY","pgn":"1. Qa3 -- 2. Qf3 -- 3. Qg2  1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":35906,"fen":"8/3Q4/8/8/8/7c/1Fb5/8 w - 0 1 $YY","pgn":"1. Qh3 -- 2. Qh8 -- 3.